    "answer": {
      "short": "$74\\text{ cm}^2$\n\nSubtract both faces of each glued contact from the separate cube surfaces.",
      "worked": "The separate cubes have total surface area $6(1^2+2^2+3^2)=84\\text{ cm}^2$. Each glued contact hides two faces: the contact areas are $1^2$ and $2^2$.\n\n$$S=84-2(1^2+2^2)=84-10=74\\text{ cm}^2.$$",
